      "content": "idk i just dont want to go to the er if it's not a big deal. it's just a tiny splash and it's not even hurting that bad, just kinda annoying and red. the drops are still good though, they aren't even expired yet. wouldn't it be easier to just nip the infection in the bud now instead of waiting for it to get bad and then having to go to a doctor anyway? like, can't i just use them once to be safe?",
